sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant OAuth as oauth-proxy Sidecar<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant REST as REST Proxy<br/>8008/TCP HTTP
    participant MM as ModelMesh Container<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant Runtime as Model Runtime<br/>(Triton/MLServer/OVMS)
    participant Puller as Puller Sidecar<br/>8086/TCP gRPC
    participant S3 as Object Storage<br/>(S3/GCS) 443/TCP
    participant etcd as etcd<br/>2379/TCP gRPC
    participant Controller as modelmesh-serving-controller
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,Runtime: Flow 1: Model Inference Request

    Client->>OAuth: HTTPS/8443<br/>TLS (serving cert)<br/>OpenShift SAR auth
    OAuth->>REST: HTTP/8008<br/>localhost (no TLS)
    REST->>MM: gRPC/8033<br/>REST→gRPC translation<br/>Optional TLS
    MM->>Runtime: gRPC/UDS<br/>pod-local<br/>No encryption
    Runtime-->>MM: Prediction Result
    MM-->>REST: gRPC Response
    REST-->>OAuth: HTTP Response
    OAuth-->>Client: HTTPS Response

    Note over Controller,etcd: Flow 2: Model Registration

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch Predictor CRs<br/>HTTPS/443<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Predictor CR Event
    Controller->>MM: gRPC/8033<br/>SetVModel / RegisterModel<br/>Optional TLS/mTLS
    MM->>etcd: gRPC/2379<br/>Store model placement<br/>TLS (client cert)
    etcd-->>MM: Placement confirmed

    Note over MM,S3: Flow 3: Model Download

    MM->>Puller: gRPC/8086<br/>Download request<br/>pod-local (no TLS)
    Puller->>S3: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>Storage credentials<br/>(from storage-config Secret)
    S3-->>Puller: Model artifacts
    Puller-->>MM: Download complete
    MM->>Runtime: Load model
